    "collapsible_content_dBDRqw": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_9BN3rB": {
          "type": "text-block",
          "settings": {
            "block_heading": "What are some of the gardening essentials products that The Green Corner carries?",
            "block_heading_tag": "h4",
            "text": "<p>The Green Corner carries a wide range of gardening essentials! We have insecticide spray and systemic insecticides for pesky insects, fungicides, fertilisers, root-growing powders to promote root health, and more! The Green Corner is also proud to showcase SILLYSOIL, our very own in-house brand carrying a great variety of gardening soil and gardening essentials!</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_block_f7LkCK": {
          "type": "text-block",
          "settings": {
            "block_heading": "Does The Green Corner offer repotting services for plants?",
            "block_heading_tag": "h4",
            "text": "<p>Yes, we do! We have a wide array of pots ranging from glazed ceramic pots and fibre glass standing pots all the way to biodegradable pots in all shapes and sizes! Do email us at <a href=\"https://thegreencorner.com.sg/\" target=\"_blank\">thegreencorner.com.sg</a> for more information. Our friendly customer service is always ready to serve you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_block_VPyQPB": {
          "type": "text-block",
          "settings": {
            "block_heading": "What is the difference between buying online at <a href=\"https://thegreencorner.com.sg/\" target=\"_blank\">TheGreenCorner.com.sg</a> and buying at your retail outlet at 3A Lor Ah Thia, Singapore 679278?",
            "block_heading_tag": "h4",
            "text": "<p>You can shop our wide array of products with just a click of a button! That is not just it! We are also opened 24/7 online, so you can shop from anywhere, at any time. We also have a loyalty point systems which can be converted into online credits, giving you great discounts of your next purchase or whenever you redeem them.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_block_PEiN4G": {
          "type": "text-block",
          "settings": {
            "block_heading": "How do I earn points when I shop online at <a href=\"https://thegreencorner.com.sg/\" target=\"_blank\">TheGreenCorner.com.sg</a>?",
            "block_heading_tag": "h4",
            "text": "<p>For every $1 you spend, you will earn 1 point. For every 100 points, you can redeem $5 off your next purchase with NO minimum purchase! It is that simple. Start shopping online today!</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_block_Ckkkm6": {
          "type": "text-block",
          "settings": {
            "block_heading": "What is the delivery timeframe for orders placed?",
            "block_heading_tag": "h4",
            "text": "<p>Our delivery team will deliver your orders within 3 to 5 business working days. Deliveries are scheduled between 10am to 7pm.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
